        -- Some abnormal case: (Now we are not clear about details, which we need to read rfc for understanding.)\
        --     About initial_secret, it seems that it is related with connection. It generates the initial_secret with DCID in the first Initial packet.\
        --     For second (and later) Initial packet, if DCID is different, it also use the previous initial_secret, and do not generate it again.\
